{"audio": "3john-01.opus", "duration_ms": 106380, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3681, "text": "3 John, Chapter One."}, {"start_ms": 3681, "end_ms": 14123, "text": "The elder, To the beloved Gaius, whom I love in the truth: Beloved, I pray that in every way you may prosper and enjoy good health, as your soul also prospers."}, {"start_ms": 14743, "end_ms": 20864, "text": "For I was overjoyed when the brothers came and testified about your devotion to the truth, in which you continue to walk."}, {"start_ms": 21644, "end_ms": 25285, "text": "I have no greater joy than to hear that my children are walking in the truth."}, {"start_ms": 26285, "end_ms": 31686, "text": "Beloved, you are faithful in what you are doing for the brothers, and especially since they are strangers to you."}, {"start_ms": 32266, "end_ms": 34566, "text": "They have testified to the church about your love."}, {"start_ms": 35127, "end_ms": 38447, "text": "You will do well to send them on their way in a manner worthy of God."}, {"start_ms": 39007, "end_ms": 43288, "text": "For they went out on behalf of the Name, accepting nothing from the Gentiles."}, {"start_ms": 44008, "end_ms": 48549, "text": "Therefore we ought to support such men, so that we may be fellow workers for the truth."}, {"start_ms": 49669, "end_ms": 55951, "text": "I have written to the church about this, but Diotrephes, who loves to be first, will not accept our instruction."}, {"start_ms": 56531, "end_ms": 60871, "text": "So if I come, I will call attention to his malicious slander against us."}, {"start_ms": 61612, "end_ms": 69073, "text": "And unsatisfied with that, he refuses to welcome the brothers and forbids those who want to do so, even putting them out of the church."}, {"start_ms": 69913, "end_ms": 73314, "text": "Beloved, do not imitate what is evil, but what is good."}, {"start_ms": 73794, "end_ms": 78555, "text": "The one who does good is of God; the one who does evil has not seen God."}, {"start_ms": 79475, "end_ms": 84196, "text": "Demetrius has received a good testimony from everyone, and from the truth itself."}, {"start_ms": 84816, "end_ms": 89017, "text": "We also testify for him, and you know that our testimony is true."}, {"start_ms": 90037, "end_ms": 94058, "text": "I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not to do so with pen and ink."}, {"start_ms": 94738, "end_ms": 98058, "text": "Instead, I hope to see you soon and speak with you face to face."}, {"start_ms": 98699, "end_ms": 99279, "text": "Peace to you."}, {"start_ms": 100019, "end_ms": 101779, "text": "The friends here send you greetings."}, {"start_ms": 102299, "end_ms": 104620, "text": "Greet each of our friends there by name."}], "words": [{"t": "3", "s": 0, "e": 2400, "si": 0}, {"t": "John,", "s": 2400, "e": 2701, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2721, "e": 3621, "si": 0}, {"t": "One.", "s": 3621, "e": 3681, "si": 0}, {"t": "The", "s": 3681, "e": 3741, "si": 1}, {"t": "elder,", "s": 3761, "e": 4001, "si": 1}, {"t": "To", "s": 5041, "e": 5121, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 5161, "e": 5241, "si": 1}, {"t": "beloved", "s": 5281, "e": 5661, "si": 1}, {"t": "Gaius,", "s": 5721, "e": 6081, "si": 1}, {"t": "whom", "s": 6241, "e": 6381, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 6501, "e": 6521, "si": 1}, {"t": "love", "s": 6581, "e": 6741, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 6741, "e": 6821, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6841, "e": 6921, "si": 1}, {"t": "truth:", "s": 7001, "e": 7281, "si": 1}, {"t": "Beloved,", "s": 7982, "e": 8362, "si": 1}, {"t": "I", "s": 8562, "e": 8602, "si": 1}, {"t": "pray", "s": 8682, "e": 8902, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 8982, "e": 9122, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 9162, "e": 9242, "si": 1}, {"t": "every", "s": 9382, "e": 9622, "si": 1}, {"t": "way", "s": 9702, "e": 9882, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 9982, "e": 10082, "si": 1}, {"t": "may", "s": 10122, "e": 10242, "si": 1}, {"t": "prosper", "s": 10362, "e": 10882, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 10982, "e": 11102, "si": 1}, {"t": "enjoy", "s": 11162, "e